"overall": "A faithful and careful rendering: no critical or major faults, tenses, persons and voices are kept, the Septuagintal readings (eructavit, dico opera mea Regi, gutta, ab intus, deprecabuntur vultum) are preserved rather than smoothed. The remaining points are minor closeness issues, chiefly 'cores' supplied twice for varietas and a few small shifts in sense. Pointing marks match the Latin in every verse."}
